        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d4e194d-67e5-48a6-819e-172556f40157).Image",
        "Description": "A contract from someone who wants to keep The Class running smoothly...\r \rDevotion has its uses — until it doesn&apos;t. A stalker fixated on Santoro. An attorney chasing Morgan&apos;s coattails for a job. A drummer chasing his fantasy of joining the band. A manager who worships Thomas Cross like scripture. An actress who can&apos;t resist a handsome stranger. All five have gotten too close, too curious, too visible. Clean it up. Quietly.",
